<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: RUGBY UNION-IRISH DIVISION ONE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-IRISH DIVISION ONE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Irish division one</p>
<p>rugby union matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Cork Constitution     18   Old Wesley		23</p>
<p> Dungannon		 18   Young Munster	   21</p>
<p> Instonians		19   Blackrock College     22</p>
<p> Lansdowne		  9   Ballymena		 10</p>
<p> Old Crescent	    17   Terenure Coll	    7</p>
<p> Shannon		   51   Old Belvedere	   15</p>
<p> St Mary's College     35   Garryowen		 27</p>
</text>
